<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Emphasis vs Italic</title>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Movie Review</h1>
<p>I think<i> The Secret Garden</i> is a beautiful movie.</p>
<p>You should <em>definitely watch it</em>- it's worth your time.</p>
<hr>
<p>Remember: i tag changes how text looks, em tag changes meaning.</p>
</body>
</html>
